ete and separate client-server chat appication.   This item requires that you integrate the live chat application into your Contoso University website in a way that is intuitive and  user-friendly.  A Person \"has a\" Address object (use composition for this). An Address object has a single property of type string for Email (for simplicity that's all an Address has)   A Student \"has a\" CreditsEarned property 10 pts: A Student \"has a\" Gpa property that can express overall grades with exactly 2 decimal points, such as 3.87, etc.  Use data attributes to insure that Email addresses entered into the system conform with the pattern [username]@contoso.edu. Hint: Refer to the regex material in the Galloway book.   Use data attributes to insure that Gpa is expressed as a value in range from 0.7 and 4.0 inclusive.   The Students (Index) view should be sortable ascending and descending according to the LastName column or the GPA column. ","topics":[],"score":229767,"global_rank":113044},{"name":"seedcode/dayback-event-requires-tags","owner":"seedcode","html_url":"https://github.com/seedcode/dayback-event-requires-tags","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Custom event action that barks if resources don't have the tags required by an event","topics":[],"score":229757,"global_rank":113052},{"name":"kvajjhula/websharer-kvajjhula","owner":"kvajjhula","html_url":"https://github.com/kvajjhula/websharer-kvajjhula","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"websharer-kvajjhula created by GitHub Classroom","topics":[],"score":229754,"global_rank":113058},{"name":"mccarthydev/coloredbalz","owner":"mccarthydev","html_url":"https://github.com/mccarthydev/coloredbalz","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"My first javascript game, you have 5 seconds to memorize the colors of the balls. Score more and more in each turn","topics":[],"score":229753,"global_ran